Teams typically migrate to Northline from one of three common setups:

- **Shared email inbox** — requests get lost or duplicated across team members [1].
- **Spreadsheet tracker** — manual status updates that fall out of sync quickly [1].
- **General-purpose project tool** — repurposed into a ticket queue even though it wasn't built for that [1].

If you're evaluating a move, check [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) or see migration options at https://northline.com/onboarding.